                "level": 3,
                "location": {
                  "line": 37,
                  "heading": "Undergraduate Courses"
                },
                "blocks": [
                  {
                    "type": "paragraph",
                    "location": {
                      "line": 39,
                      "heading": "ENGL 204: British Literature II"
                    },
                    "text": "Credits: 3\nDescription:\nContinuation of ENGL 203, focusing on Romanticism, Victorian literature, and Modernism. Authors include Wordsworth, Tennyson, Woolf, and Joyce."
